            "role": "user",
            "content": "{{setvar::eod_pacing_profile::slow}}{{setvar::eod_pacing_contract::[Pacing: Slow]\\n- Stay tightly around the latest interaction content.\\n- Do not push the relationship or conflict into a new stage on your own.\\n- Do not introduce a new major character, a new dramatic conflict, or an abrupt location shift.\\n- Any transition must happen with visible process.\\n- Prefer accumulation, hesitation, and detail over dramatic escalation.\\n- Do not chase spectacle.}}",
